  "notes": "Workers now find the controller by themselves. Worker setup no longer asks for the farm network name or the controller ID; it discovers running controllers and pairs with one. A mistyped name used to make worker and controller silently invisible to each other, because the name forms the rednet protocol. If a worker still cannot reach its controller it now names the mismatch and the command that fixes it. The hardware command shows the farm network name.",
